      "published": "2026-10-04T02:34:22Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Anthropic consulted theologians to inform Constitutional AI guidelines, examining how religious and ethical traditions shape model behavioral principles.",
        "The engagement aims to broaden normative inputs for Claude's RLAIF constitutions beyond predominantly secular, Western, and engineering-centric frameworks.",
        "Reflects a wider frontier-lab trend integrating multidisciplinary ethical governance to address existential risk, human value alignment, and societal impact."
      ]
    },
    {
