      "score": 11,
      "comments": 2,
      "author": "janus",
      "published": "2026-10-03T22:54:52Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Renovate supports cross-platform hosting across GitHub, GitLab, and Bitbucket, offering superior flexibility compared to platform-bound alternatives like Dependabot.",
        "Advanced scheduling and intelligent dependency grouping via `renovate.json` significantly mitigate PR fatigue compared to default one-PR-per-package tooling.",
        "Native monorepo support, custom regex managers, and robust automerge capabilities provide granular control over enterprise dependency lifecycles."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
      "subsource": "lobste.rs/security",
      "category": "security",
      "title": "I got targeted: Trying to get your credentials via a git post-checkout hook",
      "url": "https://frankwiles.com/posts/i-got-targeted/",
      "discuss_url": "https://lobste.rs/s/cd5gdk",
      "score": 126,
      "comments": 39,
      "author": "frankwiles",
      "published": "2026-10-02T22:19:02Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Attackers weaponize Git post-checkout hooks to automatically execute arbitrary shell scripts targeting developer environment variables, SSH keys, and cloud credentials.",
        "Payloads trigger seamlessly during branch switching or checkout operations, bypassing traditional static file scanning focused solely on source code.",
        "Defenders should override default hook directories via core.hooksPath or isolate untrusted repository clones within sandboxed containers or ephemeral VMs."
      ]
    },
