      "bullets": [
        "Cloudflare positions Workers, Durable Objects, and R2 as serverless infrastructure for hosting scalable, geo-distributed Git repositories at the edge.",
        "Implementing the Git HTTP smart protocol requires handling packfile parsing in R2 and atomic branch ref updates via Durable Objects.",
        "Serverless edge Git architectures could minimize clone latency for distributed CI/CD runners, challenging monolithic self-hosted platforms like GitLab."
      ]
